# Live Dashboard & Customizable Interface

Transform the SportApp dashboard into a high-fidelity, interactive, and personalized experience. This upgrade introduces a "Live" aesthetic and allows users to rearrange their primary tracking cards via drag-and-drop.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Layout Logic**: Moving from a fixed 2-column grid to a flexible 'Sortable' container. This may slightly change how cards stack on tablet-sized screens before they collapse to mobile view.
> [!TIP]
> **Persistence**: Your custom layout will be saved automatically to your local browser storage.

## Proposed Changes

### 🌐 Web Frontend (Dashboard & UX)

#### [MODIFY] [index.html](file:///c:/projects/SportApp/public/index.html)
- Import `SortableJS` from CDN.
- Wrap the main dashboard cards in a `#dashboardContainer` for drag-and-drop.
- Add a "Düzenle" (Edit) button to the dashboard header.

#### [MODIFY] [style.css](file:///c:/projects/SportApp/public/style.css)
- **Live Background**: Add a subtle, moving radial gradient to the body.
- **Draggable Styling**: Add ghosting effects, drag handles, and "editing mode" visual cues (shaking or dashed borders).
- **Glassmorphism 2.0**: Enhance the `style-glass` with a primary glow and smoother borders.

#### [MODIFY] [app.js](file:///c:/projects/SportApp/public/app.js)
- **Dashboard Manager**: A new module to handle card visibility and order.
- **Sortable Initialization**: Hook into the dashboard container.
- **State Persistence**: Update `S.settings` to include `dashboardOrder` and `hiddenCards`.

---

## Open Questions

- **Card Granularity**: Should we keep the "Daily Summary" as one big card or split it into smaller draggable widgets (Protein, Calories, Water, Sleep)?
- **Mobile Interaction**: On mobile, should we disable drag-and-drop to avoid accidental scrolling issues, or keep it active?

## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
- Browser test: Verify that `localStorage` correctly stores the new order after a drag event.
- Console check: Ensure SortableJS loads without blocking main app initialization.

### Manual Verification
- Drag several cards on a desktop resolution and refresh the page to ensure the order persists.
- Toggle "Edit Mode" and hide a card, then reveal it again.
- Check the "Live" background performance on a mobile device.
